{
  "$comment": "In-stream shortcuts, the contract for every port: Rust pf_client_core::shortcuts (tests.rs), Swift Shortcuts.swift, Kotlin Shortcuts.kt, TypeScript shortcuts.ts. A port that disagrees reports it; nobody edits a row to make a port pass. Blob schema v1: {\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\"|\"key\",\"keys\":[...],\"hold\":bool,\"do\":\"<action id>\"}]}. Pad keys are button names (a b x y lb rb ls rs start select guide up down left right touchpad misc1 misc2 paddle1-4; any case, back = select). Key keys are key_vk names, the last one the key, the others modifiers (ctrl alt shift). An action id is a quick-action slot id, host:<id>, shortcut:<id> or ring. Design: design/client-shortcuts.md §3, §4, §6.",

  "parse": {
    "$comment": "parse(blob).to_json() read back as JSON equals expect (field order free; a pad binding always writes hold, a key binding never does; modifiers come out ctrl, alt, shift). defaults: true means resolve() takes the client's defaults instead, because the blob is empty or not a shortcuts blob at all.",
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "a blob reads back as written",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\",\"a\"],\"hold\":false,\"do\":\"ring\"},{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\"],\"hold\":true,\"do\":\"guide\"},{\"on\":\"key\",\"keys\":[\"ctrl\",\"alt\",\"shift\",\"o\"],\"do\":\"ring\"},{\"on\":\"key\",\"keys\":[\"f11\"],\"do\":\"fullscreen\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [
          {"on": "pad", "keys": ["select", "a"], "hold": false, "do": "ring"},
          {"on": "pad", "keys": ["select"], "hold": true, "do": "guide"},
          {"on": "key", "keys": ["ctrl", "alt", "shift", "o"], "do": "ring"},
          {"on": "key", "keys": ["f11"], "do": "fullscreen"}
        ]}
      },
      {
        "name": "hold absent is a press",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\",\"x\"],\"do\":\"stats\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [{"on": "pad", "keys": ["select", "x"], "hold": false, "do": "stats"}]}
      },
      {
        "name": "button names take any case, back is select, a repeat folds",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"Back\",\"A\",\"select\"],\"hold\":false,\"do\":\"ring\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [{"on": "pad", "keys": ["select", "a"], "hold": false, "do": "ring"}]}
      },
      {
        "name": "the pad art's grip names are the paddles",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"R4\",\"l4\"],\"hold\":true,\"do\":\"ring\"},{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"r5\",\"L5\"],\"hold\":true,\"do\":\"stats\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [{"on": "pad", "keys": ["paddle1", "paddle2"], "hold": true, "do": "ring"}, {"on": "pad", "keys": ["paddle3", "paddle4"], "hold": true, "do": "stats"}]}
      },
      {
        "name": "modifier aliases fold and sort, the key is lowercased",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"key\",\"keys\":[\"shift\",\"control\",\"option\",\"Q\"],\"do\":\"release_input\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [{"on": "key", "keys": ["ctrl", "alt", "shift", "q"], "do": "release_input"}]}
      },
      {
        "name": "an unknown action keeps its row",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"start\"],\"hold\":true,\"do\":\"teleport\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [{"on": "pad", "keys": ["start"], "hold": true, "do": "teleport"}]}
      },
      {
        "name": "a key combination and a host action are kept by id",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\"],\"hold\":true,\"do\":\"shortcut:s1\"},{\"on\":\"key\",\"keys\":[\"ctrl\",\"alt\",\"shift\",\"p\"],\"do\":\"host:power.sleep\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [
          {"on": "pad", "keys": ["select"], "hold": true, "do": "shortcut:s1"},
          {"on": "key", "keys": ["ctrl", "alt", "shift", "p"], "do": "host:power.sleep"}
        ]}
      },
      {
        "name": "an unknown button drops that binding only",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\",\"zr\"],\"hold\":false,\"do\":\"ring\"},{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\",\"x\"],\"hold\":false,\"do\":\"stats\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": [{"on": "pad", "keys": ["select", "x"], "hold": false, "do": "stats"}]}
      },
      {
        "name": "an unknown key drops that binding",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"key\",\"keys\":[\"ctrl\",\"volumeup\"],\"do\":\"mic\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      },
      {
        "name": "a modifier shortcuts do not offer drops that binding",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"on\":\"key\",\"keys\":[\"win\",\"e\"],\"do\":\"mic\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      },
      {
        "name": "a binding without a device, keys or action is dropped",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[{\"keys\":[\"select\",\"a\"],\"do\":\"ring\"},{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[],\"do\":\"ring\"},{\"on\":\"pad\",\"keys\":[\"select\",\"a\"]},{\"on\":\"mouse\",\"keys\":[\"x1\"],\"do\":\"ring\"}]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      },
      {
        "name": "an empty list is no shortcuts, not the defaults",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1,\"bindings\":[]}",
        "defaults": false,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      },
      {
        "name": "an empty blob is the defaults",
        "blob": "",
        "defaults": true,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      },
      {
        "name": "a blob that is not JSON is the defaults",
        "blob": "not json",
        "defaults": true,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      },
      {
        "name": "a blob without a bindings list is the defaults",
        "blob": "{\"v\":1}",
        "defaults": true,
        "expect": {"v": 1, "bindings": []}
      }
    ]
  },

  "defaults": {
    "$comment": "defaults(client, game_mode, guide_gesture) as a blob. guide_gesture is the retired Hold Select for guide setting: on and off decide the Hold Select row where a client has one (desktop, android, apple, mac); anything else is automatic (desktop: game_mode; apple: on; android, mac: off). Clients: desktop android apple mac webos web tizen ps5 switch. The switch names wire bits, so its Minus + A is [select, b]. Order is the reference screen's: pad rows, then keys.",
