    "$comment": "Timelines through Engine(bindings, device). events and ticks merge by t (ms); at one t the events go first, in order, then the tick; flush, when given, runs last at its t. A step runs a due tick before its event. A press is held back only while the buttons down are exactly an armed hold's: a press that completes no shortcut sends any held-back press first, then itself; a release that disarms a hold sends the held-back press at once, unless another hold is then exactly down, which arms from that t. While a key-like hold is down, a further press matches no shortcut and is forwarded; the hold's own buttons still end it on their first lift. expect lists every output in order with the t it came out at: forward [button, down] (to the host, obeys the input mask), fire [action id, once|down|up|tap], lift [buttons] (release on the host, mask or not). Key devices name keys by key_vk name; left and right modifiers are one key. HOLD 1000 ms, TAP_PRESS 50 ms, KEY_TAP 350 ms.",
